I left out both operations requests. The node's `with Clock` clause grants only `wasi:clocks/wall-clock@0.2.0`. Writing to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` would need filesystem access, and calling the metadata service would need HTTP. Neither is granted, so the world has no such imports and the body cannot do either. If operations needs them, the graph would have to give this node those capabilities explicitly.

